Interview update - DevOps Engineer role (3+ years)🚀

🌍Recently, I had the opportunity to attend an interview for a "DevOps Engineer position" and it was a great experience!
I have shared the questions that were asked during my interview. These are from all 2 rounds combined. The process went well through the 2 rounds and I am happy to share that I have been selected!🔥

🧑🏫With over 3+ years of hands-on experience in cloud and DevOps, it was exciting to discuss topics:

